      "created_at": "2015-08-26T19:56:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'd say Megaopolis would not work well as it has cards that limit player choices by forcing them to skip power, play, or draw phase. &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>For a villain Ambuscade can be a fairly safe bet. &nbsp; He doesn't destroy any Ongoing or Equipment and for the most part only targets the highest health hero. &nbsp; For an environment, I would say the Block as often it just results in agents and prisoners attacking each other mostly.</p>",
