    {
      "id": 146873,
      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-26T20:17:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My default when I'm trying for max damage Absolute Zero runs is Voss in Insula Primalis. &nbsp;The only destruction on the island is Thieving Pterodactyl (easy to kill before it destroys anything), Primordial Plant Life (optional), and River of Lava (optional). &nbsp;Voss's only destruction is one of his ships. &nbsp;The ship is a bit harder to kill, but it only destroys one thing a turn and there's only one copy of it in the deck.</p><p>Mass damage is a bit more plentiful, but Insula Primalis' mass damage (other than Volcanic Eruption and Thieving Pterodactyl, both of which are easy to get rid of) is all per hero, not per hero target, keeping Unity's bots safe. &nbsp;And while Voss's ships are painful, the mass damage minions are easy to kill.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:24:52.376Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
