      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>My default when I&#39;m trying for max damage Absolute Zero runs is Voss in Insula Primalis. &nbsp;The only destruction on the island is Thieving Pterodactyl (easy to kill before it destroys anything), Primordial Plant Life (optional), and River of Lava (optional). &nbsp;Voss&#39;s only destruction is one of his ships. &nbsp;The ship is a bit harder to kill, but it only destroys one thing a turn and there&#39;s only one copy of it in the deck.</p><p>Mass damage is a bit more plentiful, but Insula Primalis&#39; mass damage (other than Volcanic Eruption and Thieving Pterodactyl, both of which are easy to get rid of) is all per hero, not per hero target, keeping Unity&#39;s bots safe. &nbsp;And while Voss&#39;s ships are painful, the mass damage minions are easy to kill.</p>",
