    {
      "id": 146874,
      "name": "Bowie",
      "username": "Bowie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bowie/{size}/2097_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-26T20:21:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, when we did the SotM Video Game \"name game\" where we had to play 3x matches with different sets of three heroes only, I basically stuck myself with Ambuscade in Silver Gulch until the next expansion, when I stuck with Ambuscade in Pike Industries-- although I ceded the floor to Powerhound before Realm of Discord came out, but I'm sure I would've taken him there, too. I tried a bunch of different villains, constantly, and found Amby in those environments to be the easiest way for me to churn through hundreds of successful games with new team arrangements.</p><p>He's predictable, safe, and those environments are, in reverse order (RoD &lt; PI &lt; SG, from easiest to hardest), pretty benign.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:24:52.440Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
