      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Yeah, when we did the SotM Video Game &quot;name game&quot; where we had to play 3x matches with different sets of three heroes only, I basically stuck myself with Ambuscade in Silver Gulch until the next expansion, when I stuck with Ambuscade in Pike Industries-- although I ceded the floor to Powerhound before Realm of Discord came out, but I&#39;m sure I would&#39;ve taken him there, too. I tried a bunch of different villains, constantly, and found Amby in those environments to be the easiest way for me to churn through hundreds of successful games with new team arrangements.</p><p>He&#39;s predictable, safe, and those environments are, in reverse order (RoD &lt; PI &lt; SG, from easiest to hardest), pretty benign.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
