      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/saykhia/{size}/2132_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-27T14:21:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I tend to do Realm of Discord for practice runs. The cards are fairly neutral, and offers interesting situations needing exploration of a new team’s individual abilities to deal with e.g adapting to Time Crawls, compensating for Positive Energy Field etc.</p>\n<p>A good villain to wail on would be poor ol’ Ambuscade (he can’t seem to catch a break).</p>\n<p>Next up from that is Baron Blade, and then Omnitron I. And then review lessons learnt with the Ennead.</p>",
